+ *
+ * Memory held, for a long-lived process (WindowServer runs this too: one queue, 50-160 small command buffers a
+ * second, for days). Two rules keep its footprint at its working set rather than its worst burst:
+ *   - placement packs: a chunk comes from the busiest slab that can give one (a returned chunk whose fence has
